{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/702394-passing-on-pure-breed-given-by-suzuka-or-zarok-on-to-cubs","id":702394,"title":"Passing on Pure Breed given by Suzuka or Zarok on to Cubs?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-10-15T12:07:01-07:00","id":702394,"title":"Passing on Pure Breed given by Suzuka or Zarok on to Cubs?","content":"Zarok gives you something much like Pure Breed, and Suzuka flat out purifies and enobles your blood, giving you an actual Pure Breed dot. So if you and a kinfolk are both originally Pure Brees 4, Suzuka or Zarok boosts you both to 5 and you have children, would you say they should inherit your normal bloodline or do they inherit the one your pack totem has bequeathed you?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-15T19:21:56-07:00","id":702869,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/702394-passing-on-pure-breed-given-by-suzuka-or-zarok-on-to-cubs#post702394\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"messa